    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d500">

                <pb facs="0807" n="791" sameAs="frus:frus1951v07p1/pg791"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">695A.0024/8–851</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of
                        Staff</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bradley</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Deputy Under Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Matthews</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-08-08">8 August 1951</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Policy on Repatriation of Chinese and North Korean
                    Prisoners.</p>
                <p>Attached is a copy of a memorandum on the above subject which we have just
                    forwarded to the Secretary of Defense. I am sending this <pb facs="0808" n="792"
                        xml:id="pg792"/> copy to you because the subject is, I know, one of extreme
                    interest to you, and, in addition, I believe that it should be handled by NSC as
                    soon as practicable. A copy of the enclosure has been forwarded to General
                    Smith.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Omar</hi> N. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Bradley</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chairman</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Joint Chiefs of Staff</hi>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d500-a1.xml" xpointer="d500-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
